* assembling payments-0.1.0 on MIX_ENV=prod
* using config/runtime.exs to configure the release at runtime

Release created at _build/prod/rel/payments

    # To start your system
    _build/prod/rel/payments/bin/payments start

Once the release is running:

    # To connect to it remotely
    _build/prod/rel/payments/bin/payments remote

    # To stop it gracefully (you may also send SIGINT/SIGTERM)
    _build/prod/rel/payments/bin/payments stop

To list all commands:

    _build/prod/rel/payments/bin/payments

